<title>PORTUGAL: EIB launches 10 bln esc Navigator bond.</title>
<headline>EIB launches 10 bln esc Navigator bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead managers Citibank and Caixa Geral de Depositos.</p>
<p>    BORROWER European Investment Bank   </p>
<p>    AMT 10 billion escudos</p>
<p>COUPON Fixed 5.82 percent first five years. Years six and</p>
<p>seven 12.25 percent less 12-month Lisbor for minimum of</p>
<p>four percent.</p>
<p>    MATURITY 12.2.04    ISS PRICE 100   REPAYMENT 100</p>
<p>    PAY DATE 12.2.97    LAST RATINGS AAA/Aaa</p>
<p>    PAY FREQ Annual     LISTING Lux</p>
<p>NOTES - Citibank Portugal is also bookrunner.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
